{"id":"71758b63b2ee2736","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-lob-sentence.md","title":"Löb Sentence $L$","display":"df-lob-sentence — Löb Sentence $L$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-lob-sentence","aliases":["92-df-lob-sentence"],"display":"df-lob-sentence — Löb Sentence $L$","depends_on":["[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-lob-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-lob-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lob-sentence — Löb Sentence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span> (provability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LobSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{LobSent}_G\\)</span> (definition-target Löb-sentence relation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LobSent}_G(L,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\nL,\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\nL\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner L\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}sentence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LobSent}_G(L,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\nL,\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\nL\\leftrightarrow\n(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner L\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\varphi\">\\(L_\\varphi\\)</span> : 关于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>的Löb句子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\varphi\">\\(L_\\varphi\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可证等价于“如果我的码可证，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>”；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a>保证这样的固定点存在</li>\n<li>在标准可导性条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash L_\\varphi\">\\(G\\vdash L_\\varphi\\)</span>当且仅当<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(G\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>；这需要可证性谓词的内化性质，不能从固定点定义单独推出</li>\n<li>这是Löb定理的核心对象</li>\n<li>其内部自指内容是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner L_\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner L_\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>实际对角构造使用辅助公式，不能以简单的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner L\\urcorner=d(\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\to\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(\\ulcorner L\\urcorner=d(\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\to\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span>代替固定点条件</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","le